{
  "slug": "origin",
  "name": "Origin",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Personal AI memory layer. Capture decisions, lessons, and context that carry across sessions.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **11 skills**, **1 hook** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (11): `brief` (Read the current Space-owned project Brief from Wenlan), `capture` (Save a memory to Wenlan in flow), `curate` (Power-user audit of Wenlan's pending surfaces: accept or dismiss pending revisions (conflicts/merges), or audit unconfirmed captures), `distill` (Synthesize wiki pages from related memories), `forget` (Delete a memory from Wenlan by ID), `handoff` (End a work session), `help` (One-screen quick reference for the Wenlan plugin), `lint` (Lint Wenlan memory quality and hygiene, check vocabulary, or resolve every finding into a ready repair, review item,…), and 3 more\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `wenlan`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install origin@claude-community` from `7xuanlu/origin` (`plugin`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 11,
    "hook": 1,
    "mcp": 1
  },
